:"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-03T12:55:37-07:00","id":1309732,"title":"","content":"Regarding Anpu and Wolf meeting, we know based on the information in Dark Eras and Sothis Ascends that Wolf realistically dies some point before Azar and Aset are killed, Sothis is formed, and Anpu is dethroned(I'll find the timeline later), so if Wolf and Anpu met, Wolf would be convening with the Anpu as the Lord of Duat.<br /> <br /> Now how likely that it is depends on your predilections of how to read the Gods of Curse and how much range you give them...but personally, any game I ran that was concerned with the Death of Wolf would include a meeting with the Foremost of the Westerners, if for no other reason than Anpu's likely to take the death of a god seriously and wants to make sure Wolf's House (read &quot;huge chunk of reality&quot;) is in order.<br /> <br /> That and I think Mummy's likely the game with the most claim to be the foundation of reality.<br /> <br /> EDIT: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/831155-did-irem-know-about-spirits?p=835505#post835505\">Timeline discussed here.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 05-03-2019, 06:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T17:16:03-07:00","id":1310143,"title":"","content":"I imagine him coming to check out the Ruckus and falling in love with the Lovely Death Wolf,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T06:17:48-07:00","id":1310274,"title":"","content":"I just find it interesting that in a relatively cosmically short space of time two dog gods in charge of separating the physical from the ephermeral were in one way or another deposed and betrayed by those closest to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T06:43:21-07:00","id":1310276,"title":"","content":"huh Maybe Father Wolf is Anpu<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GRWbIoIR04c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GRWbIoIR04c\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GRWbIoIR04c\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GRWbIoIR04c </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-07T20:40:20-07:00","id":1310663,"title":"","content":"Last I checked, Anpu isn't dead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-07T20:49:06-07:00","id":1310666,"title":"","content":"Hmm so are they Related then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-07T20:54:01-07:00","id":1310667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1264314-i-just-got-a-plot-hook-anpu-and-death-wolf-haveing-had-pups?p=1310666#post1310666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm so are they Related then.</div> </div> </div> </div>A mystery only the table can answer. The current lack of evidence doesn't really suggest it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-08T08:54:42-07:00","id":1310756,"title":"","content":"Well, playing devil's advocate, Anpu is from a realm of death and ghosts, so while he never died in the traditional sense he wasn't exactly born or alive in that sense either (granted you can make the same argument for Father Wolf but bear with me here). In addition, Egypt is full of instances of one god sort of merging with another to form a composite deity to represent facets of both gods. Example, Amun-Ra was, as you might guess, a composite of the hidden god Amun and the solar disk Ra. So if Anpu had extended his Bau unto the being of Father Wolf to aid in their mutual divine mandate of keeping the worlds of flesh and emphermera separate in their respective planes of existence, that's perfectly in keeping with the mythos.<br /> <br /> Basically, I'm making an argument that there can be that connection if the Storyteller desires and they don't even need to overtly be the same being or fundamentally change either game's storyline. You can have the echoes of the wolf god being betrayed by those who ostensibly serve it echoing through the cosmos if such serves your chronicle with relative ease. Egyptian mythology is cool like that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-08T09:25:05-07:00","id":1310765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1264314-i-just-got-a-plot-hook-anpu-and-death-wolf-haveing-had-pups?p=1310756#post1310756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, playing devil's advocate, Anpu is from a realm of death and ghosts, so while he never died in the traditional sense he wasn't exactly born or alive in that sense either (granted you can make the same argument for Father Wolf but bear with me here). In addition, Egypt is full of instances of one god sort of merging with another to form a composite deity to represent facets of both gods. Example, Amun-Ra was, as you might guess, a composite of the hidden god Amun and the solar disk Ra. So if Anpu had extended his Bau unto the being of Father Wolf to aid in their mutual divine mandate of keeping the worlds of flesh and emphermera separate in their respective planes of existence, that's perfectly in keeping with the mythos.<br /> <br /> Basically, I'm making an argument that there can be that connection if the Storyteller desires and they don't even need to overtly be the same being or fundamentally change either game's storyline. You can have the echoes of the wolf god being betrayed by those who ostensibly serve it echoing through the cosmos if such serves your chronicle with relative ease. Egyptian mythology is cool like that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I agree, and this is a great argument-and on top of that, the Necropolis of Hewara is dealing with the ghost of Death Wolf running around in Crocodile's body, so shenanigans are <i>possible*. </i>Hence why the first part is &quot;A mystery only the table can answer.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-08T11:43:56-07:00","id":1310780,"title":"","content":"Wait, Death Wolf crocodile in the Hewara tomb? You shot who in the what now? I clearly have not been keeping up well with Werewolf. What are they doing in my favorite tomb complex of the most interesting son of the most interesting pharaoh of the Middle Kingdom (no really, Senusret III is of particular interest as one of the rare empire builders of Egypt before the 18th Dynasty, and his son Amenemhat built all sorts of crazy thing like the so-called Egyptian Labyrinth and what may officially be the only pyramid tomb that was actually built with dead ends and false corridors like every video game insists all Egyptian tombs ever were built; definitely the coolest cats in the middle kingdom and in my top ten along with Khefre and Akhenaten for best pharaoh overall!).<br /> <br /> I disgress. Seriously, Death Wolf croc what?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-08T11:49:45-07:00","id":1310781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1264314-i-just-got-a-plot-hook-anpu-and-death-wolf-haveing-had-pups?p=1310780#post1310780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, Death Wolf crocodile in the Hewara tomb? You shot who in the